OL,3,GNEWSAPopular walking spot closed after
OL,4,Astorm damage
OL,5,
OL,6,FA popular walkway has been closed due
OL,7,Fto storm damage.
OL,9,FGuernsey Water said it had "no choice"
OL,10,Fbut to shut the Millennium Walk around
OL,11,FSt Saviour's Reservoir after Storm
OL,12,FAusten brought winds of up to 84mph
OL,13,F(135km/h) last week.
OL,15,FThe area would remain closed to the
OL,16,Fpublic while tree surgeons work to
OL,17,Fclear fallen trees and branches from
OL,18,Fpaths and make the area safe, staff
OL,19,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
