OL,3,GNEWSAPopular walking spot closed after
OL,4,Astorm damage
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuernsey Water customer services
OL,7,Fmanager Tania Sargent urged people not
OL,8,Fto ignore the closure signs, adding:
OL,9,F"We will re-open the walk just as soon
OL,10,Fas we can."
